ass="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-text-secondary">Use groups to organize monitor ownership and simplify filtering. Groups do not change probe types or incident flow.</p><div class="rule-list"><div class="rule-item"><CheckCircle class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-status-up" /><span>One group can contain multiple monitor types.</span></div><div class="rule-item"><CheckCircle class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-status-up" /><span>Ungrouped is always available and cannot be deleted.</span></div><div class="rule-item"><CheckCircle class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-status-up" /><span>Disabling a group does not delete its monitors.</span></div></div></aside></section>

